JubilifeCity_JubilifeTV_F4_Text_President:
	.string "Ah, the view from up here always\n"
	.string "clears my head before a big\l"
	.string "Pokétch meeting.$"

JubilifeCity_JubilifeTV_F4_Text_Receptionist:
	.string "Welcome to the top floor!\p"
	.string "This is where Jubilife TV keeps\n"
	.string "its best ideas... and its best\l"
	.string "coffee.$"

JubilifeCity_JubilifeTV_F4_Text_Breeder:
	.string "I heard they film new shows up\n"
	.string "here.\p"
	.string "I'm just hoping to spot a rare\n"
	.string "POKéMON on camera someday!$"

